        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: A possible pair of arrays is A=[6,3]A = [6, 3]A=[6,3] and B=[11,14]B = [11, 14]B=[11,14].\n\nThe only even value of i≤2i\\le2i≤2 is 222. Thus, ⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1⊕A2=6⊕3=5\\oplus A[1,i] = \\oplus A[1,2] = A_1 \\oplus A_2 = 6 \\oplus 3 = 5⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1​⊕A2​=6⊕3=5. Also, ⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1⊕B2=11⊕14=5\\oplus B[1,i] = \\oplus B[1, 2] = B_1 \\oplus B_2 = 11 \\oplus 14 = 5⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1​⊕B2​=11⊕14=5.\n\nTest case 222: A possible pair of arrays is A=[100000,98630,300000]A = [100000, 98630, 300000]A=[100000,98630,300000] and B=[200000,199334,299999]B = [200000, 199334, 299999]B=[200000,199334,299999].\n\nThe only even value of i≤3i\\le 3i≤3 is 222. Thus, ⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1⊕A2=100000⊕98630=2022\\oplus A[1,i] = \\oplus A[1,2] = A_1 \\oplus A_2 = 100000 \\oplus 98630 = 2022⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1​⊕A2​=100000⊕98630=2022. Also, ⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1⊕B2=200000⊕199334=2022\\oplus B[1,i] = \\oplus B[1, 2] = B_1 \\oplus B_2 = 200000 \\oplus 199334 = 2022⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1​⊕B2​=200000⊕199334=2022.\n\nTest case 333: A possible pair of arrays is A=[4,1,9,5]A = [4, 1, 9, 5]A=[4,1,9,5] and B=[7,2,10,6]B =[7, 2, 10, 6]B=[7,2,10,6].\n\nThe even values of i≤4i\\le 4i≤4 are 222 and 444.\n\ni=2:i = 2:i=2: ⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1⊕A2=4⊕1=5\\oplus A[1,i] = \\oplus A[1,2] = A_1 \\oplus A_2 = 4 \\oplus 1 = 5⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,2]=A1​⊕A2​=4⊕1=5. Also, ⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1⊕B2=7⊕2=5\\oplus B[1,i] = \\oplus B[1,2] = B_1 \\oplus B_2 = 7 \\oplus 2 = 5⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,2]=B1​⊕B2​=7⊕2=5.\ni=4:i = 4:i=4: ⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,4]=A1⊕A2⊕A3⊕A4=4⊕1⊕9⊕5=9\\oplus A[1,i] = \\oplus A[1,4] = A_1 \\oplus A_2 \\oplus A_3 \\oplus A_4 = 4 \\oplus 1 \\oplus 9 \\oplus 5 = 9⊕A[1,i]=⊕A[1,4]=A1​⊕A2​⊕A3​⊕A4​=4⊕1⊕9⊕5=9. Also, ⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,4]=B1⊕B2⊕B3⊕B4=7⊕2⊕10⊕6=9\\oplus B[1,i] = \\oplus B[1, 4] = B_1 \\oplus B_2 \\oplus B_3 \\oplus B_4 = 7 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 10 \\oplus 6 = 9⊕B[1,i]=⊕B[1,4]=B1​⊕B2​⊕B3​⊕B4​=7⊕2⊕10⊕6=9."
      }
